---
import { facts } from '../data/facts';
---

<section id="about">
  <div class="sec-head">
    <div class="sec-num"><b>§ 01</b> &nbsp;— About</div>
    <h2 class="sec-title">A little <em>about</em> me,<br />in plain prose.</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="about-body">
    <div class="portrait">
      <img src="/pp.jpeg" alt="Maula Irfani" width="480" height="640" />
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        I'm an <b>AI/ML engineer</b> based in Jakarta. I work across the full cycle — from data prep and model
        training, to fine-tuning, evaluation, and getting things into production.
      </p>
      <p>
        On the LLM side, most of my work lives around <b>RAG</b>, <b>agentic workflows</b>, and
        <b>multi-agent systems</b>.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm also comfortable with classical ML, and I take
        <span class="hi">MLOps seriously</span>: experiment tracking, model versioning, deployment, and
        monitoring performance in production.
      </p>

      <dl class="fact-list">
        {
          facts.map((f) => (
            <>
              <dt>{f.key}</dt>
              <dd>{f.value}</dd>
            </>
          ))
        }
      </dl>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
